{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRAGON SURVIVAL Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Introduction</strong> \u2013 Experience the beginning of the story, featuring the first encounter between the dragon and the survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Area Combat</strong> \u2013 Explore and play through the entire first island from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System Trial</strong> \u2013 Try basic melee attacks and ranged weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Boss Battle</strong> \u2013 Defeat a powerful demo-exclusive boss and claim rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy and Resource Gathering</strong> \u2013 Hunt regular monsters and collect special resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building and Crafting</strong> \u2013 Construct buildings, crafting stations, and grow crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Equipment Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Use gathered materials to upgrade weapons and armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong> \u2013 Approximately 2\u20133 hours of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Differences from the Full Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game includes <strong>all areas</strong>, a wide variety of weapons and skills, and the ability to craft everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional bosses, events, and full story chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited playtime and unlockable extra modes.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.poster.avif?t=1756776980\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.webm?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.mp4?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve crash-landed on a floating island\u2014and survival is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stranded hunter, you must team up with <strong>Ignis</strong>, a young dragon, to challenge the island\u2019s powerful rulers and collect the mana needed to escape.<br>But this is no ordinary island. It\u2019s a living, breathing world filled with untamed nature, fearsome monsters, and ancient knowledge waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.poster.avif?t=1756776980\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.webm?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.mp4?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Exploration &amp; Shifting Climates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is not one island\u2014it\u2019s many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush forests, arid deserts, frozen tundras, and molten lava fields...<br>Each island presents <strong>a unique survival challenge</strong>, with different climates, resources, crafting recipes, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy must evolve with every new environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The demo includes the temperate forest island.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.poster.avif?t=1756776980\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.webm?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.mp4?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Survival, Crafting, and Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, strengthen your armor, and build a shelter to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where resources are scarce, only those who <strong>craft what they need</strong> can survive.<br>Everything\u2014your tools, your base, your survival\u2014must be built with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decode the Lorestones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the islands are <strong>Lorestones</strong>, ancient relics left behind by explorers before you.<br>Inside them lie forgotten recipes, hidden clues, and survival secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by decoding their messages can you unlock the <strong>sealed Gates of the Island\u2019s Rulers</strong> and move forward on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the Island Rulers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each island awaits a powerful boss with unique patterns and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating them is the only way to unlock the path to the next island. <br>Stand your ground\u2014and fight alongside your dragon companion\u2014to overcome the rulers of these wild lands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2715110?t=1756776980","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2715110?t=1756776980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/712aee157a2e66f7a4baded38c94947691a889e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756776980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/712aee157a2e66f7a4baded38c94947691a889e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756776980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRAGON SURVIVAL Demo Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Introduction</strong> \u2013 Experience the beginning of the story, featuring the first encounter between the dragon and the survivor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Area Combat</strong> \u2013 Explore and play through the entire first island from the full game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System Trial</strong> \u2013 Try basic melee attacks and ranged weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Boss Battle</strong> \u2013 Defeat a powerful demo-exclusive boss and claim rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy and Resource Gathering</strong> \u2013 Hunt regular monsters and collect special resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building and Crafting</strong> \u2013 Construct buildings, crafting stations, and grow crops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Equipment Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Use gathered materials to upgrade weapons and armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated Playtime</strong> \u2013 Approximately 2\u20133 hours of gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Differences from the Full Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game includes <strong>all areas</strong>, a wide variety of weapons and skills, and the ability to craft everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional bosses, events, and full story chapters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited playtime and unlockable extra modes.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.poster.avif?t=1756776980\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.webm?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/01755e8ce5ad5c0e57903af9d917f51f.mp4?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve crash-landed on a floating island\u2014and survival is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a stranded hunter, you must team up with <strong>Ignis</strong>, a young dragon, to challenge the island\u2019s powerful rulers and collect the mana needed to escape.<br>But this is no ordinary island. It\u2019s a living, breathing world filled with untamed nature, fearsome monsters, and ancient knowledge waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.poster.avif?t=1756776980\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.webm?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/486a0e64cff83fa80fd62e9c7a97d5d5.mp4?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Exploration &amp; Shifting Climates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is not one island\u2014it\u2019s many.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lush forests, arid deserts, frozen tundras, and molten lava fields...<br>Each island presents <strong>a unique survival challenge</strong>, with different climates, resources, crafting recipes, and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strategy must evolve with every new environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(The demo includes the temperate forest island.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.poster.avif?t=1756776980\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.webm?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/1da70003405017a19944b77b7942a20e.mp4?t=1756776980\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Survival, Crafting, and Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, strengthen your armor, and build a shelter to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where resources are scarce, only those who <strong>craft what they need</strong> can survive.<br>Everything\u2014your tools, your base, your survival\u2014must be built with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decode the Lorestones</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the islands are <strong>Lorestones</strong>, ancient relics left behind by explorers before you.<br>Inside them lie forgotten recipes, hidden clues, and survival secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by decoding their messages can you unlock the <strong>sealed Gates of the Island\u2019s Rulers</strong> and move forward on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/extras/b3b490508a7bde81c8da5d00d50148b4.webp?t=1756776980\" width=751 height=54 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the Island Rulers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each island awaits a powerful boss with unique patterns and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating them is the only way to unlock the path to the next island. <br>Stand your ground\u2014and fight alongside your dragon companion\u2014to overcome the rulers of these wild lands.</p>","developers":["depth"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2706660","name":"Dragon survival"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2715110/6efff32538d69762c1650a77cec9133f83299ec0/header.jpg?t=1756776980","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257178910,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178910/movie480.mp4?t=1756776975","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178910/movie_max.mp4?t=1756776975"},"name":"Dragon Survival","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178910/6c625df4e2404e3b40bf99ade96e97eafa8b0477/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756776975","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178910/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756776975","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/